        <mxCell id="qbKF5nh3jbOio88oUKll-20" value="&lt;h1&gt;On-ramp&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Also known as an application abstraction layer&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Semantic, protocol adaption and filtering&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Using middleware appropriate for the source system.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;D365 On-ramp is also in the plan for the Section 93 initiative. We should have a single mechanism for getting data out as data changes so each initiative should deliver the data objects it needs using the D365 on-ramp component.&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=5;spacingTop=-20;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-7080" y="-8800" width="290" height="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="qbKF5nh3jbOio88oUKll-21" value="&lt;h1&gt;Foundational Data Products&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 per data governance domain to give business ownership:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Customer&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Product&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Payment&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Credit Risk&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;...&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Reusable data assets exposing canonical interfaces in both 3rd normal and 1st normal forms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Polyglot persistence - storing the data in multiple engines so we always provide efficent query&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Other teams for other initiatives will be building features we can leverage&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=5;spacingTop=-20;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-6550.5" y="-8800" width="329.5" height="280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
